'''West Asian and North African Baliscans''' ({{Langx|bl|Baliscanos Asiáticos Oeste y Africanos Norte}}) are [[Baliscans]] who were either born in or can trace their [[W:Ancestor|ancestry]] to [[W:Middle East and North Africa#WANA|West Asia and North Africa]] ([[W:MENA region|MENA region]]). It includes diverse subgroups such as [[Arab Baliscans|Arabs]], [[Azerbaijani Baliscans|Azerbaijanis]], [[Berber Baliscans|Berbers]], [[Palestinian Baliscans|Palestinians]], [[Persian Baliscans|Persians]] and [[W:Turkish people|Turks]], among others.

